    "detailed_description": "A classical Action RPG set in a sci-fi world. Battle evil robots, collect loot, upgrade your character. Wear pretty clothing for your feminine heroine, or put on powerful manly upgrades for your masculine hero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWere you ever angry at an ARPG for forcing you to choose between an elegant feminine outfit or an ugly stronger item for your heroines? Suffer no longer! In my game, more powerful items are always prettier and more feminine.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat about your masculine hero? Men do not need pretty clothing, we want to look strong and powerful! And that is what you will get if you play as a masculine hero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll the fluff is removed, what remains is the essence of what makes Action RPGs fun. I have played them all my life and I am here to make an ARPG that I would personally enjoy playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to Selfish Heroes!",
    "about_the_game": "A classical Action RPG set in a sci-fi world. Battle evil robots, collect loot, upgrade your character. Wear pretty clothing for your feminine heroine, or put on powerful manly upgrades for your masculine hero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWere you ever angry at an ARPG for forcing you to choose between an elegant feminine outfit or an ugly stronger item for your heroines? Suffer no longer! In my game, more powerful items are always prettier and more feminine.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat about your masculine hero? Men do not need pretty clothing, we want to look strong and powerful! And that is what you will get if you play as a masculine hero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll the fluff is removed, what remains is the essence of what makes Action RPGs fun. I have played them all my life and I am here to make an ARPG that I would personally enjoy playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to Selfish Heroes!",
    "short_description": "Action RPG. Sci-fi. Battle evil robots. Collect loot. Upgrade your character.",
